        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Spin. Build. Raise the Hero&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Who Trained the Hero? -Spin of Fate-&quot;</strong> is a slot-powered roguelike where you customize your reels, team up with allies, and forge the hero destined to save the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It All Starts With a SPIN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your slot, forge your hero, and spin your way through the Hero Academy. <br>Your hero, your choices—and your reels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/9ae27b528191e356d7b8b2bb2cc5373f.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/9ae27b528191e356d7b8b2bb2cc5373f.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/9ae27b528191e356d7b8b2bb2cc5373f.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin-to-Win Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck or strategy—every spin shifts the tide. Attack, defend, heal, or buff—it’s all in the reels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/5d9481e49fbf0736f06e29ae8482a9a7.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/5d9481e49fbf0736f06e29ae8482a9a7.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/5d9481e49fbf0736f06e29ae8482a9a7.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always a New Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spin rewrites your story—with new slot combos, shifting relationships, and unpredictable enemies to face every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/323650d2854b2ce3bc82b08a76e77ff4.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/323650d2854b2ce3bc82b08a76e77ff4.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/323650d2854b2ce3bc82b08a76e77ff4.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Just a Spin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train together, grow stronger, and unlock unique perks. Your fate spins with your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/3c9eb2804a21b168eb821e22e7bb314f.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/3c9eb2804a21b168eb821e22e7bb314f.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/3c9eb2804a21b168eb821e22e7bb314f.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spin by spin, choice by choice—forge the hero who changes everything.</i></strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Spin. Build. Raise the Hero&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Who Trained the Hero? -Spin of Fate-&quot;</strong> is a slot-powered roguelike where you customize your reels, team up with allies, and forge the hero destined to save the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It All Starts With a SPIN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your slot, forge your hero, and spin your way through the Hero Academy. <br>Your hero, your choices—and your reels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/9ae27b528191e356d7b8b2bb2cc5373f.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/9ae27b528191e356d7b8b2bb2cc5373f.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/9ae27b528191e356d7b8b2bb2cc5373f.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin-to-Win Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck or strategy—every spin shifts the tide. Attack, defend, heal, or buff—it’s all in the reels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/5d9481e49fbf0736f06e29ae8482a9a7.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/5d9481e49fbf0736f06e29ae8482a9a7.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/5d9481e49fbf0736f06e29ae8482a9a7.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always a New Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spin rewrites your story—with new slot combos, shifting relationships, and unpredictable enemies to face every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/323650d2854b2ce3bc82b08a76e77ff4.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/323650d2854b2ce3bc82b08a76e77ff4.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/323650d2854b2ce3bc82b08a76e77ff4.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Just a Spin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train together, grow stronger, and unlock unique perks. Your fate spins with your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/3c9eb2804a21b168eb821e22e7bb314f.poster.avif?t=1759321352\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/3c9eb2804a21b168eb821e22e7bb314f.webm?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419450/extras/3c9eb2804a21b168eb821e22e7bb314f.mp4?t=1759321352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spin by spin, choice by choice—forge the hero who changes everything.</i></strong></p>",
